0..63 Comment "//! `fnv-step` computes one step of the FNV-1a hash of 64 bits."
64..67 Comment "//!"
68..141 Comment "//! A step mixes one word into the hash: an exclusive or, then a product."
142..219 Comment "//! The product is the wrapping product with the FNV prime, modulo two to 64."
220..223 Comment "//!"
224..291 Comment "//! The grammar of the tool chain keys its walk with the same step."
292..347 Comment "//! Each expected word is the answer of that Rust step."
348..351 Comment "//!"
352..414 Comment "//! - cites: [Fowler-2026-fnv_noncryptographic_hash_algorithm]"
415..418 Comment "//!"
419..588 Comment "//! [Fowler-2026-fnv_noncryptographic_hash_algorithm]: https://doi.org/10.17487/RFC9923 \"Fowler, Noll, Vo, Eastlake and Hansen, The FNV Non-Cryptographic Hash Algorithm\""
590..654 Comment "/// `fnv_step` mixes one byte into a hash: an exclusive or, then"
655..678 Comment "/// a wrapping product."
